cruise.part.body_long_range=Heavy Long-range Jet-missile Body
cruise.desc.body_long_range=A large, simple airframe for long-distance strikes and heavy payloads. Uses an enlarged Strizh model in game.
cruise.detail.body_long_range=Body mass 350; build limit 1800. Basic navigation flies directly; advanced navigation systems are optional.
cruise.part.engine_long_range=Heavy Endurance Engine
cruise.desc.engine_long_range=High-thrust engine for the heavy long-range airframe. Heavy, but fuel-efficient.
cruise.detail.engine_long_range=Long-range body only. Thrust 1000; burn 0.72. Total mass affects actual speed and acceleration.
cruise.part.fuel_long_range=Heavy Long-range Fuel Section
cruise.desc.fuel_long_range=Large fuel reserve for distant strikes; extra mass reduces missile speed.
cruise.detail.fuel_long_range=Long-range body only. Capacity 60000 game units; mass 260. Tank capacity is not range in blocks.
cruise.part.wings_heavy_folding=Heavy Folding Endurance Wings
cruise.desc.wings_heavy_folding=Large folding wings for heavy missiles; efficient cruise at the expense of maneuverability.
cruise.detail.wings_heavy_folding=Long-range body only. Range x1.35; turning x0.65. Compatible with ground booster.
cruise.part.warhead_heavy_he=Heavy HE Warhead
cruise.desc.warhead_heavy_he=Heavy HE payload for destroying structures. Stronger blast, but lower speed and range.
cruise.detail.warhead_heavy_he=Mass 180; game power 14. Contact, delayed or airburst fuse. Check the body mass limit.
cruise.part.warhead_heavy_thermobaric=Heavy Thermobaric Warhead
cruise.desc.warhead_heavy_thermobaric=Heavy thermobaric payload with a stronger blast and larger fire cloud.
cruise.detail.warhead_heavy_thermobaric=Mass 220; game power 18. Contact or delayed fuse; airburst is incompatible.
cruise.part.warhead_fragmentation=Fragmentation Warhead
cruise.desc.warhead_fragmentation=Damages visible entities around impact, with less terrain destruction than heavy HE.
cruise.detail.warhead_fragmentation=Mass 60; power 5; fragment damage radius up to 22 blocks. Supports airburst.
cruise.part.warhead_shaped=Focused Anti-vehicle Warhead
cruise.desc.warhead_shaped=Concentrates extra damage ahead of the missile nose. A fictional anti-vehicle gameplay payload.
cruise.detail.warhead_shaped=Mass 85; power 6; focused damage up to 14 blocks. Contact or delayed fuse. Cover blocks damage lines.
cruise.part.warhead_incendiary=Incendiary Warhead
cruise.desc.warhead_incendiary=Small blast, burning visible targets and bounded surface fires.
cruise.detail.warhead_incendiary=Mass 40; power 4; radius up to 8 blocks. At most 24 fires in loaded terrain. No airburst.
cruise.part.warhead_heavy_cluster=Heavy Cluster Warhead
cruise.desc.warhead_heavy_cluster=Heavy cluster payload for distributed area effects rather than a single deep crater.
cruise.detail.warhead_heavy_cluster=Mass 180; 24 game bomblets instead of 12 in the standard cluster. Supports airburst.
cruise.part.warhead_heavy_penetrator=Heavy Penetrating Warhead
cruise.desc.warhead_heavy_penetrator=Heavy fortification payload: delayed impact blast below the surface.
cruise.detail.warhead_heavy_penetrator=Mass 260; power 14. Delayed fuse only: 10 ticks, center 2 blocks below impact. Not physical penetration simulation.
cruise.part.warhead_heavy_fragmentation=Heavy Fragmentation Warhead
cruise.desc.warhead_heavy_fragmentation=Wider fragment damage against exposed targets and a stronger local blast.
cruise.detail.warhead_heavy_fragmentation=Mass 150; power 9; radius up to 32 blocks. Cover blocks fragments. Supports airburst.
